# Applies to every `docker build` in this repo regardless of which
# Dockerfile/context is used. node_modules in particular breaks the
# web-recruiter/web-candidate Docker build context transfer outright (pnpm
# workspace symlinks confuse it) as well as being pointless bloat -- both
# Dockerfiles run their own `pnpm install` inside the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
.git
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
